1
00:00:00,797 --> 00:00:02,467
(Raj:)What is your mother going to say?

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:03,963
She's not gonna see it.

3
00:00:04,134 --> 00:00:07,014
(Howard:)She takes my temperature orally now.

4
00:00:10,349 --> 00:00:11,519
What are you gonna get?

5
00:00:11,683 --> 00:00:14,853
(Howard:)Well, I can't really decide
between a screaming devil...

6
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:18,520
(Howard:)...this mean little skull,
or Kermit the Frog.

7
00:00:18,857 --> 00:00:20,607
(Bethany:)-Kermit the Frog?
-You know:

8
00:00:20,776 --> 00:00:23,026
[MIMICS KERMIT THE FROG]
"Heigh-ho, I'm on Howard's butt."

9
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:24,615
[HOWARD CHUCKLES]

10
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:28,370
(Bethany:)Get the mean little skull,
and I'll see if I can make him smile.

11
00:00:28,533 --> 00:00:31,033
(Howard:)Yeah, I'd like the mean little skull, please.

12
00:00:31,578 --> 00:00:33,708
What are you gonna get, Raj?

13
00:00:33,872 --> 00:00:36,502
(Raj:)With my luck, hepatitis.

14
00:00:37,793 --> 00:00:39,423
(Tattooist:)Okay, here we go.

15
00:00:39,586 --> 00:00:40,836
(Howard:)Ow, ow, ow.

16
00:00:41,004 --> 00:00:42,424
(Tattooist:)That's just rubbing alcohol.

17
00:00:43,382 --> 00:00:45,552
(Howard:)I know, but it was cold.

18
00:00:45,717 --> 00:00:47,177
(Howard:)Ow, ow, ow.

19
00:00:47,344 --> 00:00:49,054
(Tattooist:)I'm putting on the stencil.

20
00:00:49,221 --> 00:00:51,761
(Howard:)-What comes after the stencil?
-This:

21
00:00:51,932 --> 00:00:53,222
[NEEDLE BUZZING]

22
00:00:53,392 --> 00:00:55,892
[SCREAMS]

23
00:00:56,561 --> 00:01:00,271
Aah! Okay, that's it. No needle.
No pain. No tattoo.

